Short:    BBS/POP3/NNTP/IRC in one system incl. Source V0.74 alpha
Author:   Thorsten Gehler
Uploader: campino@TUCHome.de (Thorsten Gehler)
Type:     comm/bbs
Version:  0.74 alpha


NOVIA INS (Interactive Network Services) is a powerfull board bulletin system System.

This System includes standart INet-Services in a BBS-System.

Features:
	
	- FIDO, UUCP, SMTP/POP3 Gateway
	- IRC Server
	- MultiUserNetworkFileSystem
	- Instand Messaging Services
	- ANSI-Terminal & Special GUI Clients. 






























